      "answer": "A",
      "answer_index": 0,
      "analysis_html": "<div class=\"math-tex math-block\" data-display=\"true\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\\text{(1)先求关于x与y的边缘密度} &amp; \\quad f_{X}(x)=\\begin{cases}x^{2}, &amp; 0\\leq x\\leq 1 \\\\0, &amp; \\text{其它}\\end{cases},\\quad f_{Y}(y)=\\begin{cases}1-|y|, &amp; \\text{当}-1\\leq y\\leq 1 \\\\0, &amp; \\text{其它}\\end{cases}. \\\\\\text{(2)计算} &amp; \\quad E(X)=\\int_{0}^{1}x^{2}\\cdot 2x\\, dx=\\frac{2}{3},\\ E(X^{2})=\\int_{0}^{1}x^{2}\\cdot 2x\\, dx=\\frac{1}{2}, \\\\&amp; \\quad E(Y)=\\int_{-1}^{1}y(1-|y|)\\, dy=0,\\quad E(Y^{2})=\\int_{-1}^{1}y^{2}(1-|y|)\\, dy=2\\int_{0}^{1}y^{2}(1-y)\\, dy=\\frac{1}{6}, \\\\&amp; \\quad D(X)=\\frac{1}{2}-\\left(\\frac{2}{3}\\right)^{2}=\\frac{1}{18},\\quad D(Y)=\\frac{1}{6}. \\\\&amp; \\quad E(XY)=\\iint_{G}xy\\, dy=\\int_{0}^{1}dx\\int_{-x}^{x}xy\\, dy=0, \\\\&amp; \\text{故}\\operatorname{cov}(X,Y)=0.\\end{aligned}\">\\begin{aligned}\\text{(1)先求关于x与y的边缘密度} &amp; \\quad f_{X}(x)=\\begin{cases}x^{2}, &amp; 0\\leq x\\leq 1 \\\\0, &amp; \\text{其它}\\end{cases},\\quad f_{Y}(y)=\\begin{cases}1-|y|, &amp; \\text{当}-1\\leq y\\leq 1 \\\\0, &amp; \\text{其它}\\end{cases}. \\\\\\text{(2)计算} &amp; \\quad E(X)=\\int_{0}^{1}x^{2}\\cdot 2x\\, dx=\\frac{2}{3},\\ E(X^{2})=\\int_{0}^{1}x^{2}\\cdot 2x\\, dx=\\frac{1}{2}, \\\\&amp; \\quad E(Y)=\\int_{-1}^{1}y(1-|y|)\\, dy=0,\\quad E(Y^{2})=\\int_{-1}^{1}y^{2}(1-|y|)\\, dy=2\\int_{0}^{1}y^{2}(1-y)\\, dy=\\frac{1}{6}, \\\\&amp; \\quad D(X)=\\frac{1}{2}-\\left(\\frac{2}{3}\\right)^{2}=\\frac{1}{18},\\quad D(Y)=\\frac{1}{6}. \\\\&amp; \\quad E(XY)=\\iint_{G}xy\\, dy=\\int_{0}^{1}dx\\int_{-x}^{x}xy\\, dy=0, \\\\&amp; \\text{故}\\operatorname{cov}(X,Y)=0.\\end{aligned}</div>"
